1
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:38,970
[The Lament of Autumn]

2
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:41,700
[Episode 16]

3
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:46,509
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

4
00:01:47,009 --> 00:01:49,539
This is the military report
we just received.

5
00:01:49,710 --> 00:01:51,810
The Qi Army suddenly attacked

6
00:01:51,830 --> 00:01:53,690
Luanjiang City of the Cheng Army.

7
00:01:53,950 --> 00:01:56,560
The Cheng Army
is urgently asking us for help.

8
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:59,590
But right now, the Qi Army

9
00:01:59,729 --> 00:02:01,330
is at the height of its power.

10
00:02:01,450 --> 00:02:02,780
If we intervene rashly,

11
00:02:02,780 --> 00:02:03,920
we'll get burned.

12
00:02:04,590 --> 00:02:05,920
It's not worth the risk.

13
00:02:06,010 --> 00:02:06,840
I agree.

14
00:02:07,420 --> 00:02:10,300
Our army has recruited many new soldiers

15
00:02:10,460 --> 00:02:12,210
who haven't finished training.

16
00:02:12,210 --> 00:02:14,610
Sending our troops
on a long expedition now

17
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:15,750
is too risky.

18
00:02:16,150 --> 00:02:17,810
It's better to hold our ground

19
00:02:18,430 --> 00:02:19,410
and wait and see.

20
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:24,060
We can wait and see.

21
00:02:24,060 --> 00:02:24,620
At a time like this,

22
00:02:24,620 --> 00:02:26,000
it's better to be cautious.

23
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:26,690
Right, right.

24
00:02:26,690 --> 00:02:27,750
Let's wait and see.

25
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:49,900
[Yu]

26
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:54,360
What?

27
00:02:55,650 --> 00:02:56,590
Any thoughts?

28
00:02:57,410 --> 00:03:00,020
The Qi Army
has deployed tens of thousands of troops.

29
00:03:00,020 --> 00:03:01,520
For a mere Luanjiang City,

30
00:03:02,190 --> 00:03:03,990
why did they make such a big fuss?

31
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:05,960
You mean...

32
00:03:06,060 --> 00:03:10,980
[Yu]

33
00:03:07,460 --> 00:03:08,300
I think

34
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:11,320
after the fall of the Cheng Army,

35
00:03:11,410 --> 00:03:12,900
their real target

36
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:15,650
is our military fortress in Pingzhou.

37
00:03:16,020 --> 00:03:19,560
Pingzhou is in a strategic location,
easy to defend and hard to attack.

38
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:21,020
They won't attack there.

39
00:03:21,590 --> 00:03:22,400
Father.

40
00:03:38,210 --> 00:03:39,670
You're right to remind me.

41
00:03:40,590 --> 00:03:42,250
I'll send more troops there

42
00:03:42,710 --> 00:03:43,970
to prepare for battle.

43
00:03:45,310 --> 00:03:46,120
That's it.

44
00:03:51,410 --> 00:03:55,030
[Xiangxi Hotel]

45
00:03:55,250 --> 00:03:56,520
It's settled then.

46
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:57,170
Alright?

47
00:03:57,170 --> 00:03:57,740
-Okay.
-Okay.

48
00:03:57,740 --> 00:03:58,340
Take care.

49
00:03:59,060 --> 00:04:00,660
Please, no need to see us out.

50
00:04:23,420 --> 00:04:24,360
How did such a beautiful

51
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:25,500
young girl

52
00:04:25,860 --> 00:04:27,690
turn into a drunkard?

53
00:04:36,310 --> 00:04:37,159
Li,

54
00:04:37,950 --> 00:04:39,060
tell me.

55
00:04:40,360 --> 00:04:42,290
Is Yu Changxuan hiding someone...

56
00:04:43,190 --> 00:04:44,510
in Fengtai?

57
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,620
What drunken nonsense
are you talking about?

58
00:04:52,620 --> 00:04:53,820
How is that possible?

59
00:04:54,190 --> 00:04:55,180
Gu and I

60
00:04:55,180 --> 00:04:56,310
go there every day.

61
00:04:56,330 --> 00:04:58,920
Fifth Young Master
is just busy with military affairs.

62
00:04:58,920 --> 00:04:59,800
Liar.

63
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:03,950
If you don't believe me,

64
00:05:03,950 --> 00:05:04,390
how about this?

65
00:05:04,390 --> 00:05:06,190
I'll drive you there to take a look.

66
00:05:06,190 --> 00:05:06,920
When we get there,

67
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:08,800
you can search from top to bottom,
inside and out.

68
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:09,720
Search thoroughly.

69
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:11,180
See if you can find anyone.

70
00:05:20,030 --> 00:05:21,430
Alright, stop drinking.

71
00:05:22,110 --> 00:05:24,160
None of you men are any good!

72
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,630
You all bully me!

73
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:26,680
You all bully me!

74
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:27,650
You all bully me!

75
00:05:27,830 --> 00:05:28,860
You all bully me!

76
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:34,360
You all bully me...

77
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:37,190
You're not allowed to remember me

78
00:05:37,190 --> 00:05:38,860
looking like a mess today.

79
00:05:40,250 --> 00:05:42,190
I'm your brother's woman.

80
00:05:57,190 --> 00:05:58,320
Fifth Young Master.

81
00:05:59,250 --> 00:06:01,960
[Bend and Flow Freely]

82
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,170
Fifth Young Master.

83
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,500
How is her appetite today?

84
00:06:17,860 --> 00:06:18,800
It's quite good.

85
00:06:19,630 --> 00:06:20,740
It looks like Miss Ye

86
00:06:20,740 --> 00:06:21,860
and you

87
00:06:21,860 --> 00:06:23,590
are getting closer and closer.

88
00:06:44,830 --> 00:06:46,100
Why are you so quiet,

89
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:47,760
not saying a single word?

90
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:54,000
I just remembered a line from a poem.

91
00:06:54,300 --> 00:06:55,630
"The peach tree blooms so bright and fair.

92
00:06:55,630 --> 00:06:57,630
Its blossoms glow with radiant air.

93
00:06:58,390 --> 00:07:00,190
This maiden goes to her new home.

94
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:03,000
To bless the house with peace and care."

95
00:07:03,950 --> 00:07:04,720
Nonsense.

96
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:07,220
These aren't peach blossoms.

97
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:15,600
No flower is as beautiful as you.

98
00:07:20,060 --> 00:07:22,190
I passed by Hengyuan Silver Shop today

99
00:07:22,650 --> 00:07:24,110
and saw a pair of earrings.

100
00:07:24,450 --> 00:07:26,710
I thought they would suit you perfectly.

101
00:07:34,390 --> 00:07:35,650
Then put them on for me.

102
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:24,400
Do I look good?

103
00:08:25,950 --> 00:08:26,720
Yes.

104
00:08:43,549 --> 00:08:44,390
Yu Changxuan.

105
00:08:45,630 --> 00:08:47,440
You promised to give me time

106
00:08:48,050 --> 00:08:49,290
and take it slow.

107
00:08:58,460 --> 00:09:00,100
I'll do whatever you say.

108
00:09:04,150 --> 00:09:04,820
Come in.

109
00:09:07,460 --> 00:09:08,870
Fifth Young Master, everything

110
00:09:08,870 --> 00:09:09,500
is ready.

111
00:09:13,700 --> 00:09:14,670
I've prepared a surprise

112
00:09:14,670 --> 00:09:15,600
for you tonight.

113
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:18,580
Okay.

114
00:09:31,260 --> 00:09:38,510
[Aerial Fireworks]

115
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:13,400
Tonight's fireworks

116
00:10:13,770 --> 00:10:15,530
are exclusively for you.

117
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:25,510
Thank you.

118
00:10:32,610 --> 00:10:35,270
[Jinhua Hall]

119
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:35,680
So beautiful!

120
00:10:36,490 --> 00:10:38,420
They look like flowers. So pretty.

121
00:10:50,650 --> 00:10:51,460
Are you cold?

122
00:10:52,420 --> 00:10:55,020
I'll have the servants
fetch a blanket for you.

123
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:56,270
It's fine.

124
00:10:57,480 --> 00:10:59,140
My shawl is in the living room.

125
00:10:59,550 --> 00:11:00,750
I'll go get it myself.

126
00:11:01,150 --> 00:11:01,870
I'll go with you.

127
00:11:01,870 --> 00:11:03,070
I'll be right back.

128
00:11:17,780 --> 00:11:20,950
[Jinhua Hall]

129
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:26,970
It's so beautiful.

130
00:11:26,970 --> 00:11:27,690
Yes.

131
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:28,870
This one is beautiful too.

132
00:11:28,870 --> 00:11:29,910
It's like a dream.

133
00:11:29,930 --> 00:11:30,560
So beautiful.

134
00:11:30,560 --> 00:11:31,200
Yes.

135
00:11:31,240 --> 00:11:32,000
There are so many more.

136
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:33,200
So pretty.

137
00:11:33,740 --> 00:11:34,460
Look!

138
00:11:48,490 --> 00:11:52,750
[Jinhua Hall]

139
00:11:50,860 --> 00:11:51,890
Go check on Miss Ye

140
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:53,440
and see why she hasn't come back.

141
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:54,130
Yes.

142
00:12:17,580 --> 00:12:18,710
Fifth Young Master.

143
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:00,130
The bleeding has stopped,

144
00:13:00,130 --> 00:13:01,630
but the patient is ice-cold all over.

145
00:13:01,630 --> 00:13:03,030
Keep monitoring the temperature and pulse.

146
00:13:03,030 --> 00:13:03,980
Keep a record.

147
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:33,490
Yu Changxuan.

148
00:13:35,680 --> 00:13:37,300
I accept your conditions.

149
00:13:39,050 --> 00:13:41,780
Just consider it
paying my debt from my past life.

150
00:14:17,580 --> 00:14:19,770
Fifth Young Master, Miss Ye is awake.

151
00:14:20,150 --> 00:14:21,940
However, she is weak right now

152
00:14:22,010 --> 00:14:23,010
and needs to rest.

153
00:15:28,410 --> 00:15:31,070
So all the beautiful moments
these past few days

154
00:15:33,130 --> 00:15:34,740
were premeditated.

155
00:15:41,500 --> 00:15:43,140
When I was most hopeful,

156
00:15:43,160 --> 00:15:44,760
you tried to commit suicide.

157
00:15:48,840 --> 00:15:51,170
You tried to take revenge on me
in this way.

158
00:17:02,270 --> 00:17:03,230
You won.

159
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:36,380
Just go.

160
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:45,270
Whether you choose to live

161
00:17:47,660 --> 00:17:48,750
or die from now on,

162
00:17:52,380 --> 00:17:53,480
let's never see

163
00:17:53,480 --> 00:17:54,590
each other again.

164
00:18:06,800 --> 00:18:07,560
Go.

165
00:20:00,660 --> 00:20:01,710
Young Master Ma,

166
00:20:02,500 --> 00:20:03,980
love

167
00:20:04,030 --> 00:20:05,960
takes two willing hearts.

168
00:20:06,350 --> 00:20:07,410
It can't be forced.

169
00:20:08,440 --> 00:20:09,570
But your appearance

170
00:20:10,070 --> 00:20:10,830
has completely disrupted

171
00:20:10,830 --> 00:20:12,180
the life I had before.

172
00:20:12,790 --> 00:20:13,720
We'd better not have

173
00:20:13,720 --> 00:20:15,050
any more interactions.

174
00:20:17,220 --> 00:20:18,140
Yu Changxuan.

175
00:20:18,830 --> 00:20:19,700
Do you know how much

176
00:20:19,700 --> 00:20:21,140
I hate you right now?

177
00:20:21,700 --> 00:20:22,500
I wish you would

178
00:20:22,500 --> 00:20:23,680
never be reincarnated!

179
00:20:23,680 --> 00:20:25,200
I wish you would go to hell!

180
00:20:34,380 --> 00:20:35,380
Yu Changxuan.

181
00:20:37,500 --> 00:20:38,960
I accept your conditions.

182
00:20:40,980 --> 00:20:43,710
Just consider it
paying my debt from my past life.

183
00:21:46,200 --> 00:21:47,050
Go now.

184
00:22:54,140 --> 00:22:55,830
Candied haws!

185
00:22:56,270 --> 00:22:59,810
Sweet candied haws!

186
00:23:01,570 --> 00:23:03,030
Mom, be careful.

187
00:23:08,480 --> 00:23:09,640
The doctor said

188
00:23:09,640 --> 00:23:11,070
you just had surgery,

189
00:23:11,070 --> 00:23:13,000
so you need to rest well to recover.

190
00:23:13,830 --> 00:23:15,140
You're one to talk.

191
00:23:15,500 --> 00:23:16,960
Look at your face.

192
00:23:17,440 --> 00:23:19,640
It's so sallow and pale.

193
00:23:22,400 --> 00:23:23,330
I'm fine.

194
00:23:23,880 --> 00:23:25,270
A couple of days ago,

195
00:23:25,380 --> 00:23:26,680
I caught a cold.

196
00:23:28,820 --> 00:23:31,240
It's all thanks to Hanzhi
that Xueting's sentence

197
00:23:31,240 --> 00:23:32,590
was commuted.

198
00:23:33,090 --> 00:23:34,010
Shouldn't we

199
00:23:34,010 --> 00:23:35,900
prepare a nice gift

200
00:23:36,330 --> 00:23:37,980
and thank her in person?

201
00:23:38,590 --> 00:23:39,220
No need.

202
00:23:45,550 --> 00:23:46,900
I mean,

203
00:23:48,030 --> 00:23:48,850
Hanzhi has been

204
00:23:48,850 --> 00:23:50,500
preparing for her graduation exams lately,

205
00:23:50,500 --> 00:23:51,740
so she's been quite busy.

206
00:23:51,740 --> 00:23:53,960
When she has some free time later,

207
00:23:54,330 --> 00:23:56,330
I will thank her properly in person.

208
00:24:09,440 --> 00:24:11,090
I just hope Xueting

209
00:24:11,220 --> 00:24:12,770
can come back soon,

210
00:24:13,140 --> 00:24:14,330
so our family

211
00:24:14,570 --> 00:24:16,030
can be reunited.

212
00:24:18,270 --> 00:24:19,070
Mom.

213
00:24:19,770 --> 00:24:21,230
Let me help you back first.

214
00:24:24,190 --> 00:24:29,550
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

215
00:24:26,880 --> 00:24:27,810
After the Qi Army

216
00:24:28,030 --> 00:24:29,720
captured the Cheng Army, their vanguard

217
00:24:29,720 --> 00:24:30,830
moved along the river valley,

218
00:24:30,830 --> 00:24:33,000
advancing rapidly towards Pingzhou.

219
00:24:33,030 --> 00:24:34,700
Fifth Young Master predicted this.

220
00:24:34,700 --> 00:24:35,660
Now it seems

221
00:24:36,220 --> 00:24:37,440
he was exactly right.

222
00:24:39,290 --> 00:24:41,700
Where is the Seventh Brigade
stationed now?

223
00:24:41,700 --> 00:24:42,700
According to your orders,

224
00:24:42,700 --> 00:24:45,030
they have already been building
fortifications on the front line.

225
00:24:45,030 --> 00:24:46,680
We must drive the Qi Army

226
00:24:46,680 --> 00:24:48,010
back to Luanjiang City!

227
00:24:51,380 --> 00:24:52,070
Commander.

228
00:24:52,770 --> 00:24:54,400
For the battle of Luanjiang City,

229
00:24:54,400 --> 00:24:56,330
please allow me to lead the troops.

230
00:25:07,880 --> 00:25:08,680
Changxuan,

231
00:25:09,000 --> 00:25:10,140
you don't have enough

232
00:25:10,140 --> 00:25:12,400
experience or ability to command troops

233
00:25:12,790 --> 00:25:13,920
on the battlefield.

234
00:25:15,480 --> 00:25:17,080
Then let Mr. Zhang come along

235
00:25:17,240 --> 00:25:18,900
to oversee and supervise.

236
00:25:19,440 --> 00:25:20,720
And there's that batch of new weapons

237
00:25:20,720 --> 00:25:22,000
from Nanhuai Arsenal.

238
00:25:23,240 --> 00:25:24,040
The first batch of equipment

239
00:25:24,040 --> 00:25:25,770
is already in mass production.

240
00:25:26,330 --> 00:25:27,830
With this equipment,

241
00:25:29,380 --> 00:25:31,380
we will definitely win this battle.

242
00:25:31,680 --> 00:25:32,380
Commander,

243
00:25:33,110 --> 00:25:34,640
please give me this chance.

244
00:25:40,180 --> 00:25:40,980
Alright.

245
00:25:41,570 --> 00:25:44,030
I'll have Mr. Zhang
and your brother-in-law

246
00:25:44,270 --> 00:25:45,350
go with you.

247
00:25:45,960 --> 00:25:46,560
Remember,

248
00:25:47,980 --> 00:25:49,510
this battle can only be won,

249
00:25:50,530 --> 00:25:51,400
not lost.

250
00:25:52,570 --> 00:25:53,240
Yes!

251
00:25:54,030 --> 00:25:55,690
I will never betray your trust, Commander!

252
00:25:55,690 --> 00:26:02,360
[Break Room]

253
00:26:01,660 --> 00:26:02,830
About going to Luanjiang,

254
00:26:02,830 --> 00:26:04,290
why don't you reconsider?

255
00:26:06,100 --> 00:26:07,780
D-Don't be so hasty.

256
00:26:08,180 --> 00:26:08,900
I know you are

257
00:26:08,900 --> 00:26:09,770
very sad right now,

258
00:26:09,770 --> 00:26:10,530
but you can't put yourself

259
00:26:10,530 --> 00:26:11,290
in danger.

260
00:26:11,290 --> 00:26:12,740
I've already made up my mind.

261
00:26:12,740 --> 00:26:13,420
Say no more.

262
00:26:13,700 --> 00:26:14,200
Is it because of

263
00:26:14,200 --> 00:26:15,180
that Ye Pingjun?

264
00:26:15,180 --> 00:26:16,570
Don't mention that name to me again.

265
00:26:16,570 --> 00:26:18,100
It has nothing to do with me.

266
00:26:18,270 --> 00:26:20,330
What do you mean
it has nothing to do with you?

267
00:26:20,330 --> 00:26:21,130
I mean, you...

268
00:26:23,270 --> 00:26:24,330
Fifth Young Master!

269
00:26:24,330 --> 00:26:25,530
Think about it again.

270
00:26:25,770 --> 00:26:26,290
This...

271
00:26:29,740 --> 00:26:30,670
Did you see that?

272
00:26:32,900 --> 00:26:34,160
He's still denying it.

273
00:26:34,400 --> 00:26:35,790
He must have been deeply provoked

274
00:26:35,790 --> 00:26:36,610
by Ye Pingjun

275
00:26:36,640 --> 00:26:37,570
to act like this.

276
00:26:37,700 --> 00:26:40,500
Don't make assumptions
about Fifth Young Master.

277
00:26:40,830 --> 00:26:41,830
We both know

278
00:26:42,030 --> 00:26:42,810
he's been waiting for

279
00:26:42,810 --> 00:26:44,090
this chance to prove himself.

280
00:26:44,090 --> 00:26:45,730
Yes, that's one aspect...

281
00:26:45,750 --> 00:26:46,880
I haven't finished talking!

282
00:26:46,880 --> 00:26:47,570
Gu!

283
00:26:47,570 --> 00:26:48,500
I'm telling you.

284
00:26:48,640 --> 00:26:49,440
Nothing can escape

285
00:26:49,440 --> 00:26:50,660
my piercing eyes

286
00:26:50,660 --> 00:26:51,900
that see through everything.

287
00:26:51,900 --> 00:26:52,740
You know?

288
00:26:53,000 --> 00:26:54,000
Keep an eye on him!

289
00:26:54,570 --> 00:26:55,170
I can never

290
00:26:55,290 --> 00:26:56,850
count on you.

291
00:26:57,070 --> 00:26:58,670
What kind of people are they?

292
00:27:00,380 --> 00:27:02,650
[Yu Mansion]

293
00:27:02,440 --> 00:27:02,830
This.

294
00:27:04,640 --> 00:27:05,740
And one more box.

295
00:27:06,290 --> 00:27:09,110
Salvia, goji berries, deer antler,

296
00:27:09,180 --> 00:27:10,110
and bird's nest.

297
00:27:10,240 --> 00:27:11,640
If we don't prepare these now,

298
00:27:11,640 --> 00:27:12,790
in that wretched place,

299
00:27:12,790 --> 00:27:14,350
you won't be able to buy

300
00:27:14,380 --> 00:27:15,410
such good things.

301
00:27:16,290 --> 00:27:16,980
This.

302
00:27:18,000 --> 00:27:18,700
I forgot it.

303
00:27:19,090 --> 00:27:20,900
Hurry and find two cooks.

304
00:27:20,900 --> 00:27:22,380
He doesn't know how to cook.

305
00:27:22,380 --> 00:27:22,940
Okay.

306
00:27:22,940 --> 00:27:23,770
Go find them.

307
00:27:26,180 --> 00:27:26,980
What's wrong?

308
00:27:27,440 --> 00:27:29,330
No need, Baoru.

309
00:27:29,700 --> 00:27:30,290
Mom.

310
00:27:30,830 --> 00:27:32,270
Ginseng, deer antler,

311
00:27:32,420 --> 00:27:33,740
crabs, shrimp legs, and rose dew.

312
00:27:33,740 --> 00:27:34,790
Did you pack them all?

313
00:27:34,790 --> 00:27:35,680
Yes, I did.

314
00:27:36,180 --> 00:27:38,640
And send all the maids and servants

315
00:27:38,700 --> 00:27:39,980
in the mansion with Changxuan.

316
00:27:39,980 --> 00:27:41,530
-Put them all in that box.
-I don't need you to worry.

317
00:27:41,530 --> 00:27:42,640
I've thought of everything.

318
00:27:42,640 --> 00:27:43,440
It would be best

319
00:27:43,440 --> 00:27:44,550
if you packed Dad's whip

320
00:27:44,550 --> 00:27:45,480
for him too.

321
00:27:45,480 --> 00:27:47,180
It can serve as a reminder
from time to time.

322
00:27:47,180 --> 00:27:48,700
Are you done talking?

323
00:27:48,700 --> 00:27:49,570
Baoru,

324
00:27:49,790 --> 00:27:51,380
that's enough.

325
00:27:51,740 --> 00:27:53,030
He's going to war,

326
00:27:53,650 --> 00:27:55,500
not to be a peddler.

327
00:27:55,530 --> 00:27:56,530
With all these things you're packing,

328
00:27:56,530 --> 00:27:57,740
how is he going to handle them?

329
00:27:57,740 --> 00:27:58,270
Exactly.

330
00:27:58,500 --> 00:28:00,330
What's wrong with caring about my son?

331
00:28:00,330 --> 00:28:01,240
Is it wrong?

332
00:28:01,330 --> 00:28:03,000
This happened so suddenly.

333
00:28:03,000 --> 00:28:04,500
I didn't even have time to prepare.

334
00:28:04,500 --> 00:28:06,090
Even with all these things,

335
00:28:06,090 --> 00:28:07,720
I'm still worried sick.

336
00:28:09,500 --> 00:28:10,790
Didn't I have

337
00:28:10,880 --> 00:28:12,270
Zhang Xiaoxian and Bingwen

338
00:28:12,270 --> 00:28:13,570
go with him?

339
00:28:13,740 --> 00:28:14,940
He usually gets to shine

340
00:28:14,940 --> 00:28:17,090
thanks to other people's achievements.

341
00:28:17,090 --> 00:28:19,480
But true gold must be tested by fire.

342
00:28:19,740 --> 00:28:21,160
This time, he fought for

343
00:28:21,240 --> 00:28:22,680
the opportunity himself.

344
00:28:22,680 --> 00:28:24,200
Let him gain some experience.

345
00:28:24,200 --> 00:28:25,700
I'm still worried.

346
00:28:26,380 --> 00:28:27,180
Mom,

347
00:28:27,440 --> 00:28:28,640
Dad said he'd be accompanied

348
00:28:28,640 --> 00:28:30,480
by a staff officer
and a brigade commander.

349
00:28:30,480 --> 00:28:31,570
He's a grown man.

350
00:28:31,570 --> 00:28:32,980
What could go wrong?

351
00:28:33,090 --> 00:28:33,880
I think

352
00:28:33,880 --> 00:28:34,790
Changxuan should go to the battlefield,

353
00:28:34,790 --> 00:28:35,480
gain some experience,

354
00:28:35,480 --> 00:28:36,570
and take a few beatings.

355
00:28:36,570 --> 00:28:38,330
Look at Xiao Beichen from Jiangbei.

356
00:28:38,330 --> 00:28:40,140
He's only a year or two older than him.

357
00:28:40,140 --> 00:28:42,940
-But he's sweeping across the battlef—
-Yu Qixuan.

358
00:28:42,940 --> 00:28:44,310
You get so excited

359
00:28:44,330 --> 00:28:45,240
and happy talking about

360
00:28:45,240 --> 00:28:46,680
someone else's brother, huh?

361
00:28:46,680 --> 00:28:48,570
Everyone else's brother
is better than yours.

362
00:28:48,570 --> 00:28:50,180
Then go call them brother.

363
00:28:50,270 --> 00:28:51,880
If you look down on him, get out.

364
00:28:51,880 --> 00:28:52,830
Out. Get out.

365
00:28:52,830 --> 00:28:53,830
Don't take up space here.

366
00:28:53,830 --> 00:28:55,180
-Alright.
-This... this list...

367
00:28:55,180 --> 00:28:56,440
She doesn't look down on

368
00:28:56,440 --> 00:28:57,200
her own brother.

369
00:28:57,200 --> 00:28:57,770
Exactly.

370
00:28:58,480 --> 00:29:00,680
Is this the Xiao Beichen you mentioned?

371
00:29:01,240 --> 00:29:01,880
Yes.

372
00:29:02,790 --> 00:29:03,590
Thank you, Dad.

373
00:29:03,590 --> 00:29:05,070
You, check this.

374
00:29:12,610 --> 00:29:13,940
What do you want from me?

375
00:29:17,000 --> 00:29:17,790
Miss Ye.

376
00:29:18,590 --> 00:29:19,660
Do you know

377
00:29:19,810 --> 00:29:21,610
that Fifth Young Master Yu is departing
early the day after tomorrow

378
00:29:21,610 --> 00:29:23,140
to fight in Luanjiang City?

379
00:29:27,700 --> 00:29:28,750
That has nothing to do with me.

380
00:29:28,750 --> 00:29:30,720
What do you mean
it has nothing to do with you?

381
00:29:30,720 --> 00:29:31,330
Your little lover,

382
00:29:31,330 --> 00:29:32,660
Jiang Xueting, has been released.

383
00:29:32,660 --> 00:29:33,270
He's fine now,

384
00:29:33,270 --> 00:29:34,790
so you don't care
if Fifth Young Master lives or dies,

385
00:29:34,790 --> 00:29:35,350
do you?

386
00:29:35,400 --> 00:29:37,110
He forced all of this.

387
00:29:37,720 --> 00:29:39,720
And now you want me to care about him.

388
00:29:39,750 --> 00:29:41,210
What kind of logic is that?

389
00:29:41,420 --> 00:29:42,220
Fine.

390
00:29:42,790 --> 00:29:43,610
If you want to blame him

391
00:29:43,610 --> 00:29:45,250
or hate him, suit yourself.

392
00:29:45,420 --> 00:29:46,480
But let me tell you,

393
00:29:47,590 --> 00:29:49,500
Jiang Xueting is a spy in the Yu Army.

394
00:29:49,500 --> 00:29:50,550
Fifth Young Master

395
00:29:50,550 --> 00:29:52,350
didn't force him to do it, did he?

396
00:29:52,610 --> 00:29:53,500
Based on his crimes,

397
00:29:53,500 --> 00:29:55,090
he should have been executed
on the spot long ago!

398
00:29:55,090 --> 00:29:55,900
Why is he fine?

399
00:29:58,400 --> 00:30:00,590
That's because Fifth Young Master,
for your sake,

400
00:30:00,590 --> 00:30:02,160
personally went to beg
the Commander-in-Chief.

401
00:30:02,160 --> 00:30:03,510
In the pouring rain and strong winds,

402
00:30:03,510 --> 00:30:05,010
he knelt for a whole night.

403
00:30:06,860 --> 00:30:07,720
And also,

404
00:30:07,940 --> 00:30:09,600
about your mother's surgery,

405
00:30:09,960 --> 00:30:11,330
you don't really think the hospital

406
00:30:11,330 --> 00:30:12,460
just showed mercy

407
00:30:12,460 --> 00:30:13,660
for no reason, do you?

408
00:30:14,390 --> 00:30:15,850
It was Fifth Young Master.

409
00:30:16,010 --> 00:30:18,050
He drove to Jinping overnight.

410
00:30:18,110 --> 00:30:19,010
To keep that specialist

411
00:30:19,010 --> 00:30:20,330
who could perform the surgery,

412
00:30:20,330 --> 00:30:20,810
he didn't even

413
00:30:20,810 --> 00:30:22,010
get his wounds dressed
after being injured in a car accident

414
00:30:22,010 --> 00:30:23,400
on the way there.

415
00:30:24,250 --> 00:30:26,050
When the surgery was finally over,

416
00:30:26,050 --> 00:30:26,880
he wanted to come back and share

417
00:30:26,880 --> 00:30:28,140
the good news with you.

418
00:30:28,900 --> 00:30:30,300
And how did you treat him?

419
00:30:32,960 --> 00:30:34,020
That knife of yours

420
00:30:35,020 --> 00:30:37,050
almost stabbed him in the heart.

421
00:30:48,420 --> 00:30:51,030
I didn't know any of this.

422
00:30:59,610 --> 00:31:00,900
That's because he never wanted you to know

423
00:31:00,900 --> 00:31:02,590
all the things he did for you.

424
00:31:06,590 --> 00:31:07,200
Yes,

425
00:31:07,500 --> 00:31:08,900
he used to be quite a jerk.

426
00:31:09,220 --> 00:31:09,770
He said a lot of

427
00:31:09,770 --> 00:31:10,810
hurtful things to you.

428
00:31:10,810 --> 00:31:12,420
He forced you to stay by his side.

429
00:31:12,420 --> 00:31:13,480
That's because...

430
00:31:15,750 --> 00:31:16,870
he never knew

431
00:31:16,890 --> 00:31:18,550
how to love someone properly.

432
00:31:21,460 --> 00:31:22,250
Miss Ye,

433
00:31:23,510 --> 00:31:24,660
I came to tell you

434
00:31:25,500 --> 00:31:26,610
all this today

435
00:31:26,860 --> 00:31:28,830
not because I'm trying to win
your sympathy for Fifth Young Master,

436
00:31:28,830 --> 00:31:30,030
nor because I'm begging you

437
00:31:30,030 --> 00:31:30,960
to love him.

438
00:31:30,960 --> 00:31:31,750
How you choose to treat him

439
00:31:31,750 --> 00:31:33,150
is between the two of you.

440
00:31:35,420 --> 00:31:36,030
I just think

441
00:31:36,030 --> 00:31:38,290
that after everything he's done for you,

442
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:42,260
you shouldn't be completely in the dark.

443
00:31:43,850 --> 00:31:45,070
It's not fair to him,

444
00:31:46,900 --> 00:31:48,630
and it's not fair to you either.

445
00:32:25,400 --> 00:32:27,070
A telegram came in from the Blacksmith.

446
00:32:27,070 --> 00:32:28,590
The Yu Army has confirmed

447
00:32:28,880 --> 00:32:29,610
that Yu Changxuan

448
00:32:29,610 --> 00:32:31,290
will personally lead the troops
to Luanjiang,

449
00:32:31,290 --> 00:32:32,580
with Kuang Bingwen as deputy commander

450
00:32:32,580 --> 00:32:34,640
and Zhang Xiaoxian as staff officer.

451
00:32:35,000 --> 00:32:36,210
Old Yu has finally agreed

452
00:32:36,210 --> 00:32:37,400
to let his precious son

453
00:32:37,400 --> 00:32:39,090
fight a real battle.

454
00:32:39,810 --> 00:32:40,650
Usually, he wishes he could

455
00:32:40,650 --> 00:32:42,710
keep him as his precious boy forever.

456
00:32:42,900 --> 00:32:44,590
But now he's heading to the battlefield,

457
00:32:44,590 --> 00:32:47,190
where bullets and blades
don't discriminate.

458
00:32:47,250 --> 00:32:50,220
Whether you're the emperor,
a commoner, a prince, or a general,

459
00:32:50,220 --> 00:32:52,900
everyone has only one life.

460
00:32:53,880 --> 00:32:54,540
Commander,

461
00:32:54,570 --> 00:32:55,530
I think

462
00:32:55,770 --> 00:32:57,310
this is a great opportunity

463
00:32:57,330 --> 00:32:58,790
to get rid of Yu Changxuan.

464
00:33:00,010 --> 00:33:01,540
We don't need to make a move.

465
00:33:02,220 --> 00:33:04,200
Someone will do it for us.

466
00:33:04,550 --> 00:33:05,930
We just need to stay here

467
00:33:07,070 --> 00:33:09,420
and wait for the good news.

468
00:33:27,570 --> 00:33:33,750
[Women's Country]

469
00:33:32,440 --> 00:33:33,900
It was Fifth Young Master.

470
00:33:34,290 --> 00:33:36,220
He drove to Jinping overnight.

471
00:33:36,380 --> 00:33:37,260
To keep that specialist

472
00:33:37,260 --> 00:33:38,530
who could perform the surgery,

473
00:33:38,530 --> 00:33:39,070
he didn't even

474
00:33:39,070 --> 00:33:40,290
get his wounds dressed
after being injured in a car accident

475
00:33:40,290 --> 00:33:41,510
on the way there.

476
00:33:42,530 --> 00:33:43,930
And how did you treat him?

477
00:33:44,530 --> 00:33:45,590
That knife of yours

478
00:33:45,980 --> 00:33:47,890
almost stabbed him in the heart.

479
00:33:50,980 --> 00:33:51,660
A long time ago,

480
00:33:51,660 --> 00:33:53,390
he already had you in his heart.

481
00:33:53,440 --> 00:33:54,100
He said a lot of

482
00:33:54,100 --> 00:33:55,180
hurtful things to you.

483
00:33:55,180 --> 00:33:56,510
He forced you to stay by his side.

484
00:33:56,510 --> 00:33:57,570
That's because...

485
00:33:58,850 --> 00:33:59,810
he never knew

486
00:33:59,810 --> 00:34:01,750
how to love someone properly.

487
00:34:12,840 --> 00:34:19,400
[Guangyi Gate]

488
00:34:14,880 --> 00:34:16,550
Mighty is the Yu Army!

489
00:34:54,840 --> 00:34:57,030
Excuse me. Please let me through.

490
00:36:29,110 --> 00:36:31,030
Woof. Woof.

491
00:36:31,180 --> 00:36:34,600
[Auspicious Clouds and Stars]

492
00:36:31,530 --> 00:36:32,760
Woof. Woof.

493
00:36:33,780 --> 00:36:35,130
Woof. Woof.

494
00:36:36,170 --> 00:36:38,360
Woof. Woof.

495
00:36:40,570 --> 00:36:41,010
Woof.

496
00:36:41,230 --> 00:36:42,780
Louder.

497
00:36:43,630 --> 00:36:45,030
Don't you know how to bark?

498
00:36:45,030 --> 00:36:45,480
Woof!

499
00:36:46,130 --> 00:36:46,570
Woof.

500
00:36:46,570 --> 00:36:47,510
That sounds awful.

501
00:36:47,510 --> 00:36:48,640
-Woof!
-Woof!

502
00:36:48,920 --> 00:36:49,440
Woof.

503
00:36:50,340 --> 00:36:51,480
Who's not barking?

504
00:36:52,150 --> 00:36:52,590
Woof.

505
00:36:56,940 --> 00:36:57,440
Do it.

506
00:36:57,680 --> 00:36:59,750
[Auspicious Clouds and Stars]

507
00:36:58,310 --> 00:36:59,370
Not making a sound?

508
00:36:59,400 --> 00:37:00,420
Not making a sound, huh?

509
00:37:00,420 --> 00:37:01,280
Not making a sound?

510
00:37:01,280 --> 00:37:02,610
I'll teach you a lesson!

511
00:37:02,610 --> 00:37:03,920
You little punk!

512
00:37:02,690 --> 00:37:04,000
[Auspicious Clouds and Stars]

513
00:37:03,950 --> 00:37:05,210
Trying to be a hero?

514
00:37:06,030 --> 00:37:06,760
Give it to me!

515
00:37:08,570 --> 00:37:09,410
Trying to be a hero, huh?

516
00:37:09,410 --> 00:37:10,030
Keep trying!

517
00:37:10,030 --> 00:37:10,290
Don't!

518
00:37:10,210 --> 00:37:11,830
[Auspicious Clouds and Stars]

519
00:37:10,320 --> 00:37:10,900
Keep trying!

520
00:37:10,900 --> 00:37:11,460
Stop whipping him!

521
00:37:11,460 --> 00:37:12,050
Move!

522
00:37:13,000 --> 00:37:13,780
Not making a sound?

523
00:37:13,780 --> 00:37:14,480
Not making a sound?

524
00:37:14,480 --> 00:37:15,410
Vice Commander!

525
00:37:15,730 --> 00:37:16,300
If you keep whipping him,

526
00:37:16,300 --> 00:37:17,550
he might die!

527
00:37:18,090 --> 00:37:19,500
So be it.

528
00:37:19,590 --> 00:37:20,570
When haven't I

529
00:37:20,570 --> 00:37:22,050
taken responsibility for you?

530
00:37:22,050 --> 00:37:23,210
Beat him to death!

531
00:37:23,900 --> 00:37:24,430
Beat him!

532
00:37:31,670 --> 00:37:32,590
Beat him hard!

533
00:37:38,900 --> 00:37:39,500
Stop.

534
00:37:47,980 --> 00:37:49,570
If you want to be a man,

535
00:37:50,000 --> 00:37:51,930
you must first learn how to be a dog.

536
00:37:52,190 --> 00:37:53,000
Understand?

537
00:37:54,630 --> 00:37:56,070
Looks like those ears of yours

538
00:37:56,070 --> 00:37:57,440
are just for show.

539
00:37:57,670 --> 00:37:59,440
There's no use keeping them.

540
00:38:08,390 --> 00:38:09,920
[Auspicious Clouds and Stars]

541
00:38:10,190 --> 00:38:11,670
You dare pull the trigger?

542
00:38:12,070 --> 00:38:13,860
Do you have the guts?

543
00:38:13,860 --> 00:38:15,260
I'm gonna die today

544
00:38:15,260 --> 00:38:16,390
or tomorrow anyway.

545
00:38:16,690 --> 00:38:17,770
I might as well fight you to the death!

546
00:38:17,770 --> 00:38:18,570
Stop!

547
00:38:24,940 --> 00:38:25,940
Put the guns down.

548
00:38:27,130 --> 00:38:27,930
Put them down!

549
00:38:27,990 --> 00:38:28,780
Do it. Do it.

550
00:38:29,570 --> 00:38:30,370
Put them down.

551
00:38:33,380 --> 00:38:34,310
Army Commander.

552
00:38:35,000 --> 00:38:35,780
The telegram said

553
00:38:35,780 --> 00:38:37,630
you wouldn't arrive
for another 2 or 3 days.

554
00:38:37,630 --> 00:38:38,730
Why are you here...

555
00:38:39,150 --> 00:38:39,780
already?

556
00:38:39,840 --> 00:38:41,100
If I hadn't come early,

557
00:38:41,230 --> 00:38:43,630
would I have gotten
to see this little show?

558
00:38:44,840 --> 00:38:45,730
Looks like

559
00:38:47,030 --> 00:38:49,030
you've lived up to my expectations.

560
00:38:49,090 --> 00:38:50,020
Army Commander.

561
00:38:50,190 --> 00:38:50,760
I...

562
00:38:51,380 --> 00:38:52,510
I had good reason...

563
00:38:53,110 --> 00:38:54,570
to punish these soldiers.

564
00:38:54,630 --> 00:38:55,150
They...

565
00:38:55,380 --> 00:38:56,340
were fighting in a group.

566
00:38:56,340 --> 00:38:56,800
Look.

567
00:38:57,090 --> 00:38:58,440
They're all bloody and battered.

568
00:38:58,440 --> 00:38:59,820
If word gets out,

569
00:39:00,340 --> 00:39:01,500
people will say we lack discipline

570
00:39:01,500 --> 00:39:02,630
and have low morale,

571
00:39:02,690 --> 00:39:03,300
which will affect

572
00:39:03,300 --> 00:39:04,800
the reputation of our Yu Army.

573
00:39:04,800 --> 00:39:05,530
So I just...

574
00:39:06,210 --> 00:39:07,510
gave them a small punishment as a warning.

575
00:39:07,510 --> 00:39:09,230
That's not true, Army Commander.

576
00:39:09,230 --> 00:39:10,670
It's Ma Liu, the clerk,

577
00:39:11,230 --> 00:39:12,570
who deducts money
from my military pay every time,

578
00:39:12,570 --> 00:39:13,770
calling it a tribute!

579
00:39:13,960 --> 00:39:14,560
I refused,

580
00:39:14,820 --> 00:39:16,960
and he's been torturing me
in different ways.

581
00:39:16,960 --> 00:39:17,480
We were really

582
00:39:17,480 --> 00:39:18,840
backed into a corner!

583
00:39:18,840 --> 00:39:21,240
You little brat, you are talking nonsense!

584
00:39:24,290 --> 00:39:25,150
I'm still here.

585
00:39:27,440 --> 00:39:28,570
Are you making decisions for me?

586
00:39:28,570 --> 00:39:29,180
No.

587
00:39:29,510 --> 00:39:30,030
No.

588
00:39:38,800 --> 00:39:40,300
Arrest Zhao Chenghai!

589
00:39:40,590 --> 00:39:41,250
-Yes!
-Yes!

590
00:39:42,190 --> 00:39:43,120
Army Commander,

591
00:39:43,630 --> 00:39:44,900
what do you mean by this?

592
00:39:44,900 --> 00:39:45,940
I have confirmed

593
00:39:46,440 --> 00:39:48,050
that Deputy Regiment Commander
Zhao Chenghai

594
00:39:48,050 --> 00:39:50,410
has spent years neglecting his duties

595
00:39:50,690 --> 00:39:53,090
and abusing his authority
to bully and oppress others.

596
00:39:53,090 --> 00:39:54,800
He has committed various crimes.

597
00:39:54,800 --> 00:39:57,330
And we have both witnesses
and physical evidence.

598
00:39:57,330 --> 00:39:59,590
What more do you have to say for yourself?

599
00:40:00,570 --> 00:40:01,500
Army Commander,

600
00:40:01,690 --> 00:40:02,840
you mean this?

601
00:40:04,340 --> 00:40:05,200
I plead guilty.

602
00:40:05,500 --> 00:40:06,300
So,

603
00:40:06,400 --> 00:40:07,590
how will I be punished?

604
00:40:07,590 --> 00:40:08,320
A fine?

605
00:40:08,570 --> 00:40:10,480
The guns and ammunition my uncle donated

606
00:40:10,480 --> 00:40:12,140
could equip a whole regiment,

607
00:40:12,190 --> 00:40:12,960
and I'm just

608
00:40:12,960 --> 00:40:14,560
a deputy regiment commander

609
00:40:14,980 --> 00:40:16,500
who's been enduring
all kinds of indignities.

610
00:40:16,500 --> 00:40:17,560
Did I say anything?

611
00:40:19,300 --> 00:40:20,900
Since he has pleaded guilty,

612
00:40:20,940 --> 00:40:22,400
execute him immediately!

613
00:40:25,900 --> 00:40:28,380
[Auspicious Clouds and Stars]

614
00:40:28,940 --> 00:40:29,770
Execute him?

615
00:40:29,800 --> 00:40:30,820
Absolutely impossible.

616
00:40:30,820 --> 00:40:31,510
No matter how tough the Army Commander is,

617
00:40:31,510 --> 00:40:32,880
he still has to show him some respect.

618
00:40:32,880 --> 00:40:33,990
He's just trying to scare him.

619
00:40:33,990 --> 00:40:35,390
He won't really kill him.

620
00:40:37,440 --> 00:40:38,370
Army Commander,

621
00:40:39,110 --> 00:40:40,640
you're going to execute me?

622
00:40:41,260 --> 00:40:43,290
Do you know who my uncle is?

623
00:40:43,780 --> 00:40:45,010
The food Yu Army eats,

624
00:40:45,010 --> 00:40:45,760
the uniforms they wear,

625
00:40:45,760 --> 00:40:46,460
the bullets they fire—

626
00:40:46,460 --> 00:40:47,480
which of those hasn't been paid for

627
00:40:47,480 --> 00:40:49,010
by our Zhao family?

628
00:40:49,380 --> 00:40:51,440
I just bullied a few little soldiers,

629
00:40:51,480 --> 00:40:53,140
and you want me to be executed?

630
00:40:53,360 --> 00:40:54,110
Then what about all the money

631
00:40:54,110 --> 00:40:55,710
we've poured into this army?

632
00:40:57,230 --> 00:40:57,960
Changxuan.

633
00:40:58,090 --> 00:40:59,380
The Zhao family
donates a large amount of military funds

634
00:40:59,380 --> 00:41:01,380
and supplies to our army every year.

635
00:41:02,030 --> 00:41:04,820
His uncle is very influential
in the business world.

636
00:41:04,820 --> 00:41:05,360
Also,

637
00:41:05,590 --> 00:41:06,340
he has many connections

638
00:41:06,340 --> 00:41:07,400
in the central government.

639
00:41:07,400 --> 00:41:09,000
It's fine, Brother-in-law.

640
00:41:09,820 --> 00:41:11,220
I know his background...

641
00:41:12,210 --> 00:41:13,230
very well.

642
00:41:19,130 --> 00:41:19,930
Yu Changxuan!

643
00:41:20,610 --> 00:41:22,050
Yu Changxuan, you can't kill me!

644
00:41:22,050 --> 00:41:22,850
Wait a minute!

645
00:41:23,000 --> 00:41:23,800
Wait a minute!

646
00:41:26,440 --> 00:41:27,570
Fifth Young Master.

647
00:41:29,170 --> 00:41:30,900
The Commander-in-Chief called.

648
00:41:30,900 --> 00:41:32,900
This person is to be sent back to Nanhuai.

649
00:41:32,900 --> 00:41:34,650
He wants to interrogate him personally.

650
00:41:34,650 --> 00:41:35,480
I told you they couldn't do anything

651
00:41:35,480 --> 00:41:36,340
to Deputy Regiment Commander Zhao.

652
00:41:36,340 --> 00:41:37,530
Whoever comes is just putting on a show.

653
00:41:37,530 --> 00:41:38,840
They can't do anything to our commander.

654
00:41:38,840 --> 00:41:41,440
In the end,
it would still be the same old story.

655
00:41:53,170 --> 00:41:54,360
Execute him first!

656
00:41:54,730 --> 00:41:55,690
Then I'll answer the phone!

657
00:41:55,690 --> 00:41:56,280
Yes!

658
00:41:56,280 --> 00:41:57,030
Yu Changxuan!

659
00:41:57,030 --> 00:41:57,690
Changxuan.

660
00:41:59,070 --> 00:41:59,470
You...

661
00:42:00,300 --> 00:42:00,940
Let me go!

662
00:42:00,940 --> 00:42:02,860
Yu Changxuan, you can't kill me!

663
00:42:03,140 --> 00:42:03,980
Yu Changxuan!

664
00:42:03,260 --> 00:42:05,020
[Auspicious Clouds and Stars]

665
00:42:04,960 --> 00:42:05,590
Let go!

666
00:42:07,070 --> 00:42:07,800
Let go!

667
00:42:10,590 --> 00:42:11,870
The Army Commander actually has the guts?

668
00:42:11,870 --> 00:42:13,330
He actually executed him?

669
00:42:13,400 --> 00:42:16,330
How will he explain this
to the Commander-in-Chief?

670
00:42:29,380 --> 00:42:30,030
If anyone in the Yu Army

671
00:42:30,030 --> 00:42:31,690
is bullied and humiliated,

672
00:42:32,690 --> 00:42:34,400
it is a disgrace to the Yu Army,

673
00:42:35,570 --> 00:42:37,530
and a dereliction of my duty.

674
00:42:38,880 --> 00:42:39,810
Starting today,

675
00:42:40,480 --> 00:42:41,340
those days

676
00:42:42,090 --> 00:42:42,780
are over.

677
00:42:43,940 --> 00:42:45,000
Under my command,

678
00:42:45,670 --> 00:42:47,200
military rules are strict,

679
00:42:47,280 --> 00:42:49,360
and rewards and punishments are clear.

680
00:42:49,360 --> 00:42:50,960
Background does not matter,

681
00:42:51,530 --> 00:42:53,630
and rank makes no difference.

682
00:42:54,090 --> 00:42:56,550
Those who distinguish themselves in battle

683
00:42:56,670 --> 00:42:59,070
and those who are loyal, brave,
and upright

684
00:42:59,190 --> 00:43:00,650
will be greatly rewarded.

685
00:43:02,480 --> 00:43:03,480
On the other hand!

686
00:43:05,570 --> 00:43:08,030
Anyone who deceives their superiors
or subordinates,

687
00:43:08,030 --> 00:43:09,500
or harms their comrades,

688
00:43:10,030 --> 00:43:11,290
just like in this case,

689
00:43:12,070 --> 00:43:13,380
will be executed without mercy!

690
00:43:13,380 --> 00:43:15,380
-Bravo!
-Great!
